WEBVTT

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.770
There is... nothing left for me any more.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.290
Really, such a poor girl.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:14.430
Being left sick, and losing your parents in a plane crash...

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:18.260
Though, you don't have anything to worry about here, with the doctors available at all times, right?

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:21.190
Indeed! That's very true!

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:25.820
Well, we'll stop by to check up on you once in a while. Okay, Chiho-chan?

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:38.070
After that, they only came to visit me when they wanted to discuss the sale of the house.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:43.250
Yes... I've lost my parents, and I've lost the house we lived in as well.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.300
I don't have... anything left.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.920
That is what I thought.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.150
Until I met her.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:12.380
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:12.380
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:19.470
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:19.470
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:26.310
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:26.310
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:32.490
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:32.490
I will believe in your smile

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.700
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.700
If I can protect your dream,

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.290
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.290
I will even embrace pain

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:49.590
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:49.590
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:56.340
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:56.340
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:04.560
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.140
yes, my passion accelerates

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:04.560
as if it were rushing through my body

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:10.730
aa, donna unmei datte

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:10.730
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:21.870
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:15.030
yes, I can fly high over it

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:21.870
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:31.790
Onee-chan, how long have you been sick?

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:33.940
Since the day I was born.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.600
Since... you were born?

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:45.780
Yes. But I never thought I was unfortunate because my parents took very good care of me.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.410
Where are your mom and dad?

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:50.870
They're not here anymore.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.960
Not here?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.620
Are you alone?

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:54.920
I'm not...

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.710
I still have Uzume-chan by my side.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:04.130
Uzume, tell us your reason! Why must you fight us?

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.340
My reason? There's only one reason possible, isn't there?

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.930
Because... we are Sekirei!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:18.040
That time, I finally realized the reason why I was born.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:23.940
Honestly, why do the tenants of this inn have to do the shopping?

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:27.590
You're always just lazing around anyway, aren't you?

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:29.160
Lazing around...?

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.560
Listen here, Miya...

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.290
Oh, right! I wonder if I already received the last month's rent from you...

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.860
Oh, okay! I'll dash for it right away!

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:45.220
Being a Sekirei sure is handy at times like these.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:51.810
Well, I don't feel like participating in the Sekirei Project at all...

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:57.340
But in that case... I wonder why I was actually born?

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.030
This is the shopping I did...

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.180
Huh?

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.700
I-Is that...?

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:14.910
No!

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:17.620
Don't get tangled up!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:18.790
Huh?

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.630
Wha- Wait!

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:25.090
I have no idea what happened, but suicide won't solve anything!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.100
Huh?

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:45.450
Just as I thought...

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.520
This girl is...

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.560
This girl is...

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.670
My...

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.820
Who are you...?

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.220
What's your name?

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:57.000
It's... Chiho.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:04:59.660
I found you.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.020
Excuse me?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.920
The reason for me to live, perhaps.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.630
That's right, it's to protect Chiho!

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:14.920
Uzume-san, you're serious about this, right?

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:15.510
I am.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.680
You're absolutely serious, right?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.350
Yes, I am...

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.900
You're absolutely, completely sure that you're serious, right?

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.310
You're so annoying!

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:28.230
Then I shall fight you, with all my pride as a Sekirei!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:31.200
I'm strong, you know?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:34.820
I've gotten stronger from the Landlady's training as well!

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:36.370
Musubi!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.370
Your attitude there gives off a really good vibe!

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.010
What's the matter? You should come, too.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:54.480
One against one is the basic rule of a Sekirei battle.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.430
Since Musubi moved out first, I'll oversee this battle until the end.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.000
Is that so...

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.260
She could have just called us out one by one...

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.820
I don't know your reasons,

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:16.910
but did you really think that putting yourself in disadvantage would make you feel better about deceiving us?

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:22.870
Stubborn as usual, I see. Though, I guess that's just the way you are, Tsukiumi-tan.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:25.080
I truly liked all of you!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.020
Where are they?

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:40.220
There's no way No. 10 would succumb to her emotions, as long as her Ashikabi's life is on the line, right?

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:43.380
Ashikabi... Chiho-san's life...

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.900
Is that why she asked Musubi-chan and Tsukiumi to...?

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:51.200
A time will come when you'll have to fight, even if you do not want to...

00:06:56.230 --> 00:07:01.180
Honestly, why do the bad predictions come true all the time?

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:20.830
You're doing pretty well. I expected nothing less of you, Musubi-tan.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.390
But we're only getting started!

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.650
Got you!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:32.110
Cloth drill!

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.030
Musubi-chan!

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:34.740
Minato!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.250
Stop this, please!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.440
This is-

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:47.920
Tsukiumi?

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.840
Sekirei fight for the sake of their Ashikabi.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:54.800
That's what Uzume is doing right now as well.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:58.170
S-Still... The two of them fighting is just...

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.970
Tsu-Tsukiumi...?

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.360
Uzume-san, you're really strong!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.280
You finally realized?

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:22.290
But... I won't let you defeat me!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.740
Me neither.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.210
Oh?

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.350
Uzume?

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.690
This is it, huh?

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:38.550
Uzume-san...

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.170
You've really become strong, Musubi-tan...

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.890
You're amazing yourself...

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.090
Wha- What...?

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.250
Musubi-chan!

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.350
She used up all of her energy.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.680
This battle ends in a draw.

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:54.860
Musubi!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:02.370
Tsukiumi!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.910
Y-You scum!

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:08.370
No. 18, Ichiya. I'll be taking your life.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.290
You are...!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.520
No. 16, Toyotama.

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:14.460
As the master commanded, I will erase you.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.300
Water Spear!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:25.720
Tsukiumi-san!

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.090
Tsukiumi!

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.390
No!

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.020
Don't come any closer!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.940
This is a Sekirei battle!

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:34.070
Tsukiumi! Behind you!

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:41.570
Two against one is a bit unfair, don't you think?

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:42.490
Homura?!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.290
We will be your opponents now.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.580
Kazehana!

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.640
Yes. The reinforcements have arrived.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.000
What would you like me to do?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.920
It doesn't matter any more. Retreat.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.840
Understood.

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:05.930
That's the signal to retreat.

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:09.270
Hmph, and it was just getting entertaining.

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:11.180
Running away?!

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.270
Oh, no!

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:16.270
Kazehana!

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.150
I'll be taking your life!

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.360
Musubi-chan!

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.590
Uzume-san...

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:38.130
I see! You won't be lonely as long as you have Uu-chan, right?

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.330
Yup.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:45.950
To me... Uzume-chan is the most important person.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:52.430
That was uncalled for...

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:54.770
Scum, how dare you-!

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:56.800
Kazehana?

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.360
Uzume-san...?

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.780
The Sekirei crest is...

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:18.030
Yes... No 10. suddenly jumped in and Toyotama...

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:21.120
Oh, well. That works too.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.000
Very well.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:32.250
Aww... I was supposed to be the one to take care of her...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.640
Well, what a shame.

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:37.770
You were too late, Nee-san.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:39.270
Honestly...

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:42.350
Wearing only your underwear again?

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.870
You really don't care what the public thinks, do you?

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.480
Uzume-san...

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.330
You protected me, and...

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:57.150
Somehow... My body reacted on its own...

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.230
I'm so stupid, aren't I?

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.240
Uzume-san...

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:08.900
Say, Sahashi-chan... Can I ask you for a favour?

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:13.930
Could you please help my Chiho?

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:21.740
I don't think I can do anything for her any more...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.060
Instead of me...

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.320
But...!

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:30.740
Please. Promise me.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:51.210
I will.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:55.660
No matter... No matter what happens, I will definitely protect her.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.430
So don't worry about anything, and just leave it to me.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:12.020
Chiho, you really like looking up at the sky, don't you?

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:13.540
But...

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.360
Hm?

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.330
I wonder how many more times I'll get to see it.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:23.770
Be it one hundred or two hundred times more, I'll show it to you again.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:25.540
Uzume-chan...?

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.970
If it's for you, I'll show you anything.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.470
So...

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:35.470
So... Give your whole self to me, please.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.020
Yep. I will.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:42.190
I will always, always protect you, okay?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.110
I love you, Chiho.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:10.000
This wide blue sky... I wish I could've shown her more of it.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:14.300
Sorry... I'm so sorry, Chiho.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.730
That's why Kuu gave it her best!

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:29.090
You're amazing, Kuu-chan.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.310
Yup!

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:30.990
Huh?

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.150
Onee-chan...? Are you crying?

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:39.190
I heard... just now...

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:42.210
This is a farewell... right?

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.210
That outfit...

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:20.940
It's hers. Does it suit me?

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:25.090
You've been drinking all night, haven't you?

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.510
Have I?

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:29.940
You took those from the kitchen, didn't you?

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.490
If Miya finds out...

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:35.600
I don't feel drunk no matter how much I drink, though.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.050
Then why don't you quit drinking altogether?

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.510
M-Miya!

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:45.180
These... I'm just borrowing them...

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.190
Maybe I should have some too.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:59.490
This place has gotten really quiet now.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.320
Miya...

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:04.920
Uzume was happy, right?

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.470
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.790
Thank you for the drink.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:17.170
You two make sure that you always return, no matter where you go.

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:22.610
One person living here, who doesn't pay the rent or ever come back, is enough.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.560
Oh, I've entered the wrong room again.

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:35.730
C'mon, Sahashi-chan! What's up with the gloomy face?

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.910
Please forgive me, Chiho-san.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.360
It's not your fault, Sahashi-san.

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:48.210
Uzume-chan made the decision herself.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.190
And all of it... for me.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.010
Onee-chan!

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:56.190
Chiho-san!

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.290
Uzume-san saved me in the end.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:08.770
That's why I'm going to win the Sekirei Project, and bring Uzume-san back to you!

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.190
Please, believe in me.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:14.060
Wishes do come true!

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.610
They do!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:18.620
She's right! Uu-chan will come back!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.150
Kuu-chan...

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.810
Onee-chan will get better, too!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.740
My Onii-chan will definitely make that happen!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.240
That's right.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.670
Nothing will happen if I shut myself in my room.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.070
Matsu-san! I need to talk to you!

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:45.260
Oh, I was just about to call you.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.180
Oh?

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.990
I did a lot of research afterwards, and...

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:52.960
it turns out that Higa was holding the key to Chiho's treatment.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.120
Really? So that's why Uzume-san...

00:17:56.120 --> 00:18:01.400
I tried looking for the methods of treatment, but the data was already erased.

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:02.860
Then we can't...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:07.940
We can't keep her in a hospital controlled by Higa at this point.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:12.540
That's why I moved her to a small private hospital for now.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:16.230
Wh-What about the M.B.I. hospital where I stayed the last time?

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:21.680
You have to be either an M.B.I. official, or someone related to the Sekirei Project to...

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.260
But Chiho-san was...!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:28.680
Since she lost her Sekirei, all the rights of an Ashikabi were nullified too.

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.100
But that's...

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:34.430
Matsu-san.

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.370
Oh, what is it?

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:39.640
Isn't there a way to meet this Higa guy personally?

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:40.730
Meet Higa?

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:42.720
I know it's dangerous...

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:49.160
But I believe that meeting him personally, and asking about Chiho-san's treatment method is the only way.

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.450
I was waiting for you to say that!

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:52.620
Eh?

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:56.460
My blood is finally starting to boil!

00:18:56.460 --> 00:19:00.150
Playing around with the sacred bond between an Ashikabi and a Sekirei is unacceptable!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.840
If someone starts a fight with me, I will gladly take them on!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:05.720
Ma-Matsu-san, what are you planning to do?

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:10.930
Not much. I'm just going to make Higa want to meet you, even if it's against his will.

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:14.520
I'll make him feel the wrath of an ex-member of the Disciplinary Squad!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.150
Higa-sama!

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:27.700
The systems of our daughter companies are crashing one after another, and seem to be unrepairable.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:32.540
There's not much we can do against such a fast and accurate attack on this scale...

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:37.640
And that's not all of it. Our stock price seems to have greatly decreased as well.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:40.090
I see. So this is all their doing.

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:40.880
Eh?

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.800
It means that physical battles are not their only option.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.630
So... you mean...?

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:50.680
It's an attack from the North, there's no mistake.

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:51.900
From the North?

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:56.470
Goodness... They really are reliable.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:03.570
They'll definitely go bankrupt at this rate!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.990
Switching to the top speed mode!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.790
A-Amazing...

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:14.380
Is that the attack we've launched against the East?

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.330
I'm not sure what's going on, but Matsu's not bad when she actually tries, eh?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:21.630
I don't understand at all, but Matsu-san is amazing!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.300
Wow!

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:28.130
After having done all this, Higa will have to contact us, whether he likes it or not.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:35.280
Hello?

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.730
Yes, hello...

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:38.890
What?

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:42.080
Mina-tan?

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.000
It's the hospital...

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.950
They said Chiho-san's state has become critical...

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.330
Onee-chan...

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:57.410
Her condition suddenly changed, and the doctor said they have no way to treat her...

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:01.670
Onii-chan?

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:05.920
Damn it!

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:23.360
Sahashi Minato-kun, I presume?

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:26.320
Um... Yes.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:30.240
That was quite an impressive attack you pulled off.

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:31.940
Attack...?

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:34.700
Then you're the one from the East?

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:38.620
It's a pleasure to meet you. My name is Higa Izumi.

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:43.040
So... we finally meet.

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:57.270
Koko de deatta yo ne itsumo waratteta yo ne

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:57.270
Wasn't it here we've met, where we laughed together?

00:21:57.410 --> 00:22:03.180
Hashaide bakkari So My Friend

00:21:57.410 --> 00:22:03.180
We were always so happy, so my friend...

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:08.180
Kimi no inai heya de omoidaseru mono wa

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:08.180
When you're not in the room, all I can remember about you

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:11.450
Egao no kakera

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:11.450
are the fragments of your smile.

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:18.850
Koko de oshaberi shita koi no hanashi mo shita

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:18.850
We used to chat here, we also exchanged the words of love

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:24.690
Yo ga akeru made na no ni

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:24.690
Until the morning came. However...

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:29.630
Toki ni fuseru hitomi tameiki mo doushite

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:29.630
But why did you not notice

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:34.830
Kizukenakatta darou

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:34.830
When I occasionally lowered my eyes, or my sighs?

00:22:35.510 --> 00:22:43.090
Atatakai basho de matteru yo

00:22:35.510 --> 00:22:43.090
I'll be waiting at a warm place

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.090
Tada ima no koe wo

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.090
For your welcoming voice.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:53.870
Aa kimi wa sukoshi nagai sanpo

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:53.870
Ah, you're just taking a walk which is

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.870
Shite iru dake da ne

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.870
A little long, aren't you?

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:10.990
Mamoru ai yakusoku oboete iru kara ne

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:10.990
I'll hold onto this love, for I still remember the promise we made.

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:19.550
Higa Izumi of the East.

00:23:19.550 --> 00:23:20.890
Sanada Nishida of the West.

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:23.390
Mikogami Hayato of the South. And what about you?

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:25.440
Sahashi Minato of the North.

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:27.250
Why do you sound southern then?

00:23:27.250 --> 00:23:29.230
Well, I can't help that...

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:31.970
Episode eleven: Preparations for the Festival.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.860
Next time, and forever and ever!

00:23:33.860 --> 00:23:35.200
Who gets the credit for this?
